28787cc312df1d7109206e61b34c7012.mp4?t=1786739015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/b7b92300190fe0da6c16053b9a4d3912.avif?t=1786739015\" width=800 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >World War II is over, but the hatred for everything that your child’s past represents lives on. Born as a Lebensborn, your child will be confronted with discrimination, cruelty, and hatred by the community around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you stand up to the community and confront them, or do you and your child try to hide from it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/e1edaec92093de9b28ec08d5b06e8eff.poster.avif?t=1786739015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/e1edaec92093de9b28ec08d5b06e8eff.webm?t=1786739015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/e1edaec92093de9b28ec08d5b06e8eff.mp4?t=1786739015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover their past, the story of the &quot;Lebensborn&quot;. Find hidden links to your child’s biological parents, and confront the realities of the present that your child now faces.<br><br>The decisions you make will change them forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/d3443200dc915caf31ffdc8bd3f6f908.poster.avif?t=1786739015\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/d3443200dc915caf31ffdc8bd3f6f908.webm?t=1786739015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/d3443200dc915caf31ffdc8bd3f6f908.mp4?t=1786739015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/aa409b1aa605720055645cc18d87885c.avif?t=1786739015\" width=400 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Child Lebensborn has been developed in collaboration with the Norwegian Lebensborn children from World War II and has led to the foundation of The Children Born of War Project, working to protect children of enemy soldiers the world over. Parts of the proceeds of the game are donated to this cause.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras/b56d33136d439cec1732ac321bef3a71.avif?t=1786739015\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/extras_big/b56d33136d439cec1732ac321bef3a71.webp?t=1786739015 width=1560 height=736 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Adopt Karin or Klaus in this dark, story-driven parenting game. Help your child cope with the effects of hatred and bullying. Balance resources to meet their needs. Based on the true stories of the Lebensborn children, you’ll make difficult choices that will impact your child’s life forever.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Indonesian, Hindi, Ukrainian", "reviews": "“My Child Lebensborn tells a disturbing tale about innocents in the aftermath of WW2 - Colin Campbell”<br>Polygon<br><br>“The game succeeds in blending the love and care… with a blunt historical accuracy reminiscent of the times. - Iain Harris”<br>PocketGamer<br><br>“My Child Lebensborn will leave any caring, persistent player with an indelible memory. - Simon Parkin”<br>The Guardian<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/fe432ba78abae0486e4629c5bab68873233630b7/header.jpg?t=1786739015", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/b7d5e488a317fbb10b9c9258684f32a977056ca8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786739015", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2430730/b7d5e488a317fbb10b9c9258684f32a977056ca8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786739015", "website": "https://www.mychildgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Pentium 2GHZ or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10,DX11,DX12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DX10,DX11,DX12 compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Teknopilot AS"